; Pending transactions are staged one-time payments. Every transaction in this
; file is pending; the plugin tags it `#pending` and flags it `!` when the
; ledger loads, so it is obvious in Fava. `beanschedule reconcile` matches one
; by account, amount and date (within four days), applies its splits, and
; removes it from this file.

